    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f Immerse yourself in a relaxing, contemplative adventure with The Last Shores, a top-down 3D solar-punk exploration game where nature and mystery meet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Play as Tal, a young biologist on a mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freshly graduated from GREEN-CORP University and sent to an abandoned island for a one-year internship, your objective is simple: clean up the entire island, restore the ecosystems and unravel the secrets buried beneath these forgotten lands. But you'll soon discover that there's much more to this island than meets the eye...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556780/extras/1dc42d438c1b7980aa5395bea001473b.poster.avif?t=1747136546\" width=606 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556780/extras/1dc42d438c1b7980aa5395bea001473b.webm?t=1747136546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556780/extras/1dc42d438c1b7980aa5395bea001473b.mp4?t=1747136546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A living, poetic world</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and recycle waste to bring the island back to life.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair wind turbines to generate energy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for small animals and rediscover lush nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar from cliff tops to explore freely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth buried treasures all around the island ( it'll make memories ).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556780/extras/69f32714323a75e42bd22cbe3edd6741.poster.avif?t=1747136546\" width=606 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556780/extras/69f32714323a75e42bd22cbe3edd6741.webm?t=1747136546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556780/extras/69f32714323a75e42bd22cbe3edd6741.mp4?t=1747136546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0e <strong>An ancient civilization and a family mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your adventure unfolds, you'll discover runes, forgotten ruins and a huge sealed chasm. By activating ancient mechanisms and following clues left by your missing father, you gradually reveal the story of a vanished civilization... and perhaps that of your own past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556780/extras/80ec0a1049decd22dc2d2529542ea09d.poster.avif?t=1747136546\" width=606 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556780/extras/80ec0a1049decd22dc2d2529542ea09d.webm?t=1747136546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556780/extras/80ec0a1049decd22dc2d2529542ea09d.mp4?t=1747136546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>An immersive, soothing experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible gameplay, ideal for relaxing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solar punk-inspired art direction, with bright, enchanting environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soothing soundtrack to accompany your exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let yourself be carried away by the gentleness of the wind and the song of the waves... and discover the secrets of The Last Shores. \ud83c\udf3f\u2728</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f Immerse yourself in a relaxing, contemplative adventure with The Last Shores, a top-down 3D solar-punk exploration game where nature and mystery meet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Play as Tal, a young biologist on a mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freshly graduated from GREEN-CORP University and sent to an abandoned island for a one-year internship, your objective is simple: clean up the entire island, restore the ecosystems and unravel the secrets buried beneath these forgotten lands. But you'll soon discover that there's much more to this island than meets the eye...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556780/extras/1dc42d438c1b7980aa5395bea001473b.poster.avif?t=1747136546\" width=606 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556780/extras/1dc42d438c1b7980aa5395bea001473b.webm?t=1747136546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556780/extras/1dc42d438c1b7980aa5395bea001473b.mp4?t=1747136546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A living, poetic world</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and recycle waste to bring the island back to life.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair wind turbines to generate energy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for small animals and rediscover lush nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar from cliff tops to explore freely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth buried treasures all around the island ( it'll make memories ).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556780/extras/69f32714323a75e42bd22cbe3edd6741.poster.avif?t=1747136546\" width=606 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556780/extras/69f32714323a75e42bd22cbe3edd6741.webm?t=1747136546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556780/extras/69f32714323a75e42bd22cbe3edd6741.mp4?t=1747136546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0e <strong>An ancient civilization and a family mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your adventure unfolds, you'll discover runes, forgotten ruins and a huge sealed chasm. By activating ancient mechanisms and following clues left by your missing father, you gradually reveal the story of a vanished civilization... and perhaps that of your own past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556780/extras/80ec0a1049decd22dc2d2529542ea09d.poster.avif?t=1747136546\" width=606 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556780/extras/80ec0a1049decd22dc2d2529542ea09d.webm?t=1747136546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556780/extras/80ec0a1049decd22dc2d2529542ea09d.mp4?t=1747136546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>An immersive, soothing experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible gameplay, ideal for relaxing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solar punk-inspired art direction, with bright, enchanting environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soothing soundtrack to accompany your exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let yourself be carried away by the gentleness of the wind and the song of the waves... and discover the secrets of The Last Shores. \ud83c\udf3f\u2728</p>",
    "short_description": "\ud83c\udf3f The Last Shores is a chill solar-punk adventure. Clean, explore, and uncover the secrets of a forgotten island while restoring its lost harmony. \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f\u2728",
